<p class="p5"><b>Slip 1</b></p>
<p class="p5"><b>Q.1)</b> Identify two implications that might affect mobile forensic in the future due to <b>5G technology</b>. [15]<br>
<b>Q.2)</b> Explain one <b>real-world challenge law enforcement faced</b> due to 5G-enabled devices. [10]<br>
<b>Q.3)</b> Viva – How does <b>5G low latency</b> impact forensic investigations? [5]<br>
<b>Q.4)</b> Lab Book – Document your analysis of 5G’s implications in mobile forensics. <span class="Apple-tab-span">	</span><span class="Apple-converted-space">  </span>[5]</p>
<p class="p6"><br></p>
<p class="p5"><b>Slip 2</b></p>
<p class="p5"><b>Q.1)</b> Explain<b> SIM cards in non-technical terms</b>. [15]<br>
